<includeonly><onlyinclude>*{{2c}} difficulty for this sub-chapter multiplies enemy strength magnifications by {{{1}}}%.{{#if:{{{2|}}}|
*{{3c}} difficulty for this sub-chapter multiplies enemy strength magnifications by {{{2}}}%.|}}{{#if:{{{3|}}}|
*{{4c}} difficulty for this sub-chapter {{#ifeq:{{{3}}}|100|makes no change to enemy strength magnifications|multiplies enemy strength magnifications by {{{3}}}%}} and only allows [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]] to be deployed.|}}</onlyinclude></includeonly>
==Usage==
<pre>{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}</pre>
gives
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

If difficulty is less than {{4c}} then this doesn't display higher magnifications.
<pre>{{LegendDiff|100}}</pre>
gives
{{LegendDiff|100}}